        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "a543adce-dfda-5764-9712-95e887d5f678",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Akshay Kumar, Nagarjuna, Pooja Bhatt, Sonali Bendre, Anu Malik, Aadesh Shrivastava\n- Products: Angaaray (1998 film)\n- Topics: Akshay Kumar filmography, box office performance, death from cancer\n\nFacts:\n- Angaaray is a 1998 film that stars Akshay Kumar, Nagarjuna, Pooja Bhatt, and Sonali Bendre in lead roles.\n- The music for Angaaray was composed by Anu Malik and Aadesh Shrivastava.\n- In the 1990s, Angaaray was among several Akshay Kumar releases that performed poorly at the box office and caused a setback in his film career.\n- Aadesh Shrivastava died of cancer in Kokilaben Hospital a day after turning 51.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
